{"id":"91e419d6023b31d0","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-effective-simple-complete.md","title":"有效简单集合的 Turing 完全性","display":"thm-effective-simple-complete — 有效简单集合的 Turing 完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-effective-simple-complete","aliases":["20-thm-effective-simple-complete"],"display":"thm-effective-simple-complete — 有效简单集合的 Turing 完全性","chapter":"5","section":"5.4.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.4.1；式 (5.11)","source_pdf_pages":[152,153],"source_printed_pages":[117,118],"depends_on":["[[20-df-effective-simple]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-movable-markers]]","[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-effective-simple-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-effective-simple-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-effective-simple-complete — 有效简单集合的 Turing 完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.4.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.4.1；式 (5.11)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span><span>153</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>117</span><span>118</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ec173dab9734388\" href=\"?note=3ec173dab9734388\" title=\"20-df-effective-simple\">20-df-effective-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A)\\)</span> 经全可计算基数界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s,K_s\">\\(A_s,K_s\\)</span> 是固定递增有限枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)=\\mu s\\,[x\\in K_s]\">\\(\\theta(x)=\\mu s\\,[x\\in K_s]\\)</span> 为部分函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i(s)\">\\(a_i(s)\\)</span> 是阶段补集标记，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\">\\(a_i\\)</span> 是最终补集的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1\">\\(i+1\\)</span> 小成员。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ec173dab9734388\" href=\"?note=3ec173dab9734388\" title=\"20-df-effective-simple\">20-df-effective-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}simple\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TK.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}simple\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TK.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用带参数递归定理取得全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>，其程序先等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>，若在阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\">\\(\\theta(x)\\)</span> 入，则枚举当时补集的前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(h(x))+1\">\\(b(h(x))+1\\)</span> 个数；否则永不枚举。因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{h(x)}=\\{a_0(\\theta(x)),\\ldots,a_{b(h(x))}(\\theta(x))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{h(x)}=\\{a_0(\\theta(x)),\\ldots,a_{b(h(x))}(\\theta(x))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span> 时成立，不入时为空。编译器仅等待 c.e. 事件并计算有限标记，所以完全符合参数递归定理的普通可计算前提。</p>\n<p>借 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> oracle 求最终补集的前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(h(x))+1\">\\(b(h(x))+1\\)</span> 个成员，再模拟到这些标记全部等于真实值，令首个这样的阶段为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(x)\">\\(r(x)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\le_TA\">\\(r\\le_TA\\)</span>。标记单调，故之后该初段永不改变。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\\ge r(x)\">\\(\\theta(x)\\ge r(x)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{h(x)}\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\">\\(W_{h(x)}\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\)</span>，但它有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(h(x))+1\">\\(b(h(x))+1\\)</span> 个不同成员，违背有效简单界。故任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span> 必在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(x)\">\\(r(x)\\)</span> 之前入，得到</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\\iff x\\in K_{r(x)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in K\\iff x\\in K_{r(x)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_TA\">\\(K\\le_TA\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 c.e.，停机集的一一完备性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_TK\">\\(A\\le_TK\\)</span>，两方向合成结论。这补出了自索引、有限候选集及 oracle 停止界三步，而不以“原书有证明”代替本条验证。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 117–118 / PDF 152–153。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-effective-simple","status":"resolved","id":"3ec173dab9734388","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238d